---
description: Never add Cursor attribution to git commits or PRs
alwaysApply: true
---

Never add "Co-authored-by: Cursor", "Made-with: Cursor", or any Cursor attribution trailer to commits or pull requests.

When committing, use plain `git commit -m` or `-F` without `--trailer`. If a trailer appears in the message file, amend or rewrite the commit to remove it before finishing.
